	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gaudeo te nobis restitutum; graviter enim dolebam, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cum ex proximis fratris mei literis intellexissem te min<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>us bene valere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Laborabat eodem tempore hic quoque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>d. <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> ita, ut valde eius vitae metuerem; sed <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et ipse per domini gratiam restitutus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dominus utrumque vestrum servet <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nobis quam diutissime!</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Interea accepi ea, quae per <persName ref="p6793">Dumysium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>misisti, et ago tibi pro illis gratias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Remitto etiam eadem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>per ipsum, ut petisti, una cum literis illis, quas de causa <placeName ref="l2478">Sabau<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dica</placeName> ad me scripsisti; nolui eas retinere, cum viderem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ipsas tam sollicite et toties abs te repeti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Habes rationes <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non aspernandas; timemus vero, ne, quod tu maxime desideras, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>impetrari possit, constans scilicet et perpetua pax.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Metuunt multi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>boni viri, ne, quicquid agitur, cedat ad suppressionem <placeName ref="l167">Genevensi<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>um</placeName>, et hoc ipsi olfaciunt; proinde, quantum intelligo, abhorrent <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ab illa pacificatione.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quid legati hic impetraturi sint, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nondum scio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nudiustertius a senatu, heri a diacosiis auditi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sunt; sed nihil aliud ipsis fuit responsum, quam quod <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>prius <placeName ref="l21">Badenae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ideo petierunt hodie iterum audiri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>illud sit aut quid respondendum etiam sit, nondum scio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Cives inter <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>se admodum dissident, et metuo turbas inter nos, quas dominus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>clementer avertat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Inventa est ab ipso consule his diebus <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>cantilena quaedam non insulsa contra pacificatores <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>istos scripta; ea valde turbavit senatum; author tamen inve<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>niri non potest.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quod <persName ref="p3099">Sulceri</persName> negotium attinet, cum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nostris hisce diebus de eo conferre nihil potui propter prae<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sentiam istorum legatorum; contuli tamen cum d. <persName ref="p6793">Dumysio</persName>; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>is aget cum nostris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Dolebam, quod ad senatum vocatus <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>esset; visus enim fuerat plaerisque satisfecisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Nunc verum vi<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>deo bonum hoc fuisse, cum ita deprehensus sit in mendacio, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>et non dubito, quin nostri hoc aegerrime sint laturi et con<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>sensuri in literas <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensibus</placeName> mittendas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Utinam inde <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>amoveri et ecclesia <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> ab isto fermento ex<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>purgari possit!</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> diversa afferuntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quidam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nuper <placeName ref="l301">Lugduno</placeName> reversus dicebat <placeName ref="l830">Anglos</placeName> pace facta ex <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><placeName ref="l2770">Nordmannia</placeName> discessisse; nunc fertur eos fortiter pergere <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>et <placeName ref="l832">Gallos</placeName> multis cladibus afficere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Itaque nihil hic mihi constat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Salutant te vicissim nostri omnes, quęstor <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, <persName ref="p8417">Mu<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>sculus</persName>, socer, fratres item ac symmystae omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem dic <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>meo nomine tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 14. augusti <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>1563.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>[oannes] Hallerus</persName>, perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">T<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>igurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>suo honorando et com<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>patri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>n</persName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
